From c963b6c854fe02b5270eee20e2cf9f12ee2d4633 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Silvio Vilerino <sivileri@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 11:19:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] d3d12: Do not use
 D3D12_VIDEO_ENCODER_PICTURE_CONTROL_CODEC_DATA1 as in/out param arg

Reviewed-by: Pohsiang (John) Hsu <pohhsu@microsoft.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/43715>
---
 src/gallium/drivers/d3d12/d3d12_video_enc.cpp | 38 ++++++++++++++-----
 src/gallium/drivers/d3d12/d3d12_video_enc.h   |  2 +
 .../drivers/d3d12/d3d12_video_enc_av1.cpp     |  2 +-
 .../drivers/d3d12/d3d12_video_enc_h264.cpp    |  2 +-
 .../drivers/d3d12/d3d12_video_enc_hevc.cpp    | 10 ++---
 .../d3d12_video_encoder_references_manager.h  | 15 +++++++-
 ...2_video_encoder_references_manager_av1.cpp |  4 +-
